  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARM: ODIHR Armenia Election Observation Mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The British Embassy Yerevan seeks to meet the UK&#x2019;s commitment to supporting OSCE/ODIHR election observation by providing Long-term
Observers (LTOs) to the OSCE/ODIHR election observation mission (EOM) for the Parliamentary Election in Armenia on 07 June 2026. The
main beneficiaries of this work will be OSCE/ODIHR, whose mission will benefit from the expertise of the UK observers, and the Armenian electorate,
whose confidence in the electoral process will be increased by the presence of a strong contingent of international observers.</narrative>
  </description>
